OL,3,GNEWSAThe volunteers who spend their
OL,4,Atime saving city's historic buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Doncaster Civic Trust was founded
OL,7,Fin 1946, the town was facing its
OL,8,Fpostwar future as redevelopment plans
OL,9,Floomed.
OL,11,FVolunteers keen to protect its Georgian
OL,12,Fand Victorian heritage formed the
OL,13,Ftrust, which is celebrating its 80th
OL,14,Fbirthday with an exhibition at the
OL,15,Fnow-city's Danum Library, Gallery and
OL,16,FMuseum.
OL,18,FIt is still run by those who give their
OL,19,Ftime for free out of pride, and they
OL,20,Fhave succeeded in saving a number of
OL,21,Fprominent local buildings from the
OL,22,Fwrecking ball.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
